<title>HONG KONG: Indonesia's Bank Central Asia sets US$150 mln FRCD.</title>
<headline>Indonesia's Bank Central Asia sets US$150 mln FRCD.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was</p>
<p>announced by arranger and bookrunner LTCB Asia.</p>
<p>BORROWER BANK CENTRAL ASIA ACTING THROUGH ITS NASSAU BRANCH</p>
<p> AMT	US$150 MLN  COUPON    6ML+62.5   MATURITY    6 YRS</p>
<p> TYPE     FRCD	  ISS PRICE PAR	  LAUNCHED    28.AUG.96</p>
<p> PUTS     YR 3	  CALLS     YR 3	 REPLIES     16.SEP.96</p>
<p> LISTING  NONE	  REPAYMENT BULLET     DENOMS	US$250K</p>
<p> RATINGS  NONE	  SALE LMTS CUSTOMARY</p>
<p> NEG PLG  NO	    CRS DEF   YES	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW  ENGLISH     HOME CTRY INDONESIA  TAX PROV    STANDARD</p>
<p> PAY DATE 15.OCT.96   NOTES     - -</p>
<p> MGT LEVELS AND FEES  CO-ARGRS  US$8 MLN+  35   BP  ALL-IN 74</p>
<p>			    CO-LEADS  US$5-7 MLN 31.5 BP  ALL-IN 73</p>
<p>			    SNR MGRS  US$2-4 MLN 28.5 BP  ALL-IN 72</p>
<p>ARRANGER  CHASE MANHATTAN ASIA, COMMERZ SOUTHEAST ASIA,</p>
<p>	     LTCB ASIA (BOOKS), SAKURA MERCHANT BANK SINGAPORE,</p>
<p>	     SANWA INTERNATIONAL FINANCE.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843-6371</p>
